1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,379
Welcome!

2
00:00:02,319 --> 00:00:07,270
In this short video, you'll learn how to buy USDT, step by step.

3
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,755
It only takes a few minutes,

4
00:00:08,695 --> 00:00:11,927
and we'll show you how to stay safe along the way.

5
00:00:13,047 --> 00:00:15,232
First, what is USDT?

6
00:00:15,172 --> 00:00:19,282
USDT, also known as Tether, is a stablecoin.

7
00:00:19,222 --> 00:00:22,648
Its value is designed to stay close to one US dollar,

8
00:00:22,588 --> 00:00:26,336
so its price doesn't jump up and down like Bitcoin.

9
00:00:26,276 --> 00:00:30,208
That's why people use it to save, send money, and trade.

10
00:00:31,428 --> 00:00:34,466
Before you start, make sure you have three things.

11
00:00:34,406 --> 00:00:36,269
A smartphone or a computer,

12
00:00:36,209 --> 00:00:40,205
a valid ID, such as a passport or a national ID card,

13
00:00:40,145 --> 00:00:44,102
and a payment method, like a bank card or a bank account.

14
00:00:45,322 --> 00:00:45,958
Step one:

15
00:00:45,898 --> 00:00:51,082
choose a trusted exchange that is licensed and available in your country.

16
00:00:51,022 --> 00:00:55,223
Download its official app, or type the website address carefully,

17
00:00:55,163 --> 00:00:57,520
because fake copies do exist.

18
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,852
Tap Sign up, enter your email address,

19
00:00:59,792 --> 00:01:02,573
and create a strong, unique password.

20
00:01:02,513 --> 00:01:05,741
Then confirm with the code sent to your email.

21
00:01:06,961 --> 00:01:09,163
Step two: protect your account.

22
00:01:09,103 --> 00:01:13,699
Open Security settings and turn on two-factor authentication.

23
00:01:13,639 --> 00:01:15,293
With an authenticator app,

24
00:01:15,233 --> 00:01:19,236
every login needs a fresh six-digit code from your phone.

25
00:01:19,176 --> 00:01:23,124
So even if someone steals your password, they can't get in.

26
00:01:24,344 --> 00:01:26,909
Step three: verify your identity.

27
00:01:26,849 --> 00:01:31,932
This is called KYC, and most regulated exchanges require it.

28
00:01:31,872 --> 00:01:33,741
Take a clear photo of your ID,

29
00:01:33,681 --> 00:01:36,966
then a quick selfie, to prove it's really you.

30
00:01:36,906 --> 00:01:40,098
Approval can take from a few minutes up to a day.

31
00:01:41,318 --> 00:01:43,799
Step four: add money to your account.

32
00:01:43,739 --> 00:01:47,050
Tap Deposit and choose your local currency.

33
00:01:46,990 --> 00:01:50,705
Select a payment method, such as a bank transfer or a card,

34
00:01:50,645 --> 00:01:53,013
enter the amount, and confirm.

35
00:01:52,953 --> 00:01:56,953
Always check the fees and the final amount before you pay.

36
00:01:58,173 --> 00:02:00,557
Step five: buy USDT.

37
00:02:00,497 --> 00:02:03,452
Go to Buy, and search for USDT.

38
00:02:03,392 --> 00:02:05,539
Enter how much you want to spend.

39
00:02:05,479 --> 00:02:09,659
The app shows how much USDT you'll get, including fees.

40
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:13,630
Check the details, tap Buy USDT, and confirm.

41
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:14,479
Done!

42
00:02:14,419 --> 00:02:18,315
Your USDT now appears in your wallet balance.

43
00:02:19,535 --> 00:02:24,168
Step six is optional: sending USDT to another wallet.

44
00:02:24,108 --> 00:02:28,627
Tap Withdraw, choose USDT, and paste the receiving address.

45
00:02:28,567 --> 00:02:30,481
Never type it by hand.

46
00:02:30,421 --> 00:02:35,678
Now the most important part: choose the correct network,

47
00:02:35,618 --> 00:02:39,654
for example TRC-20, ERC-20, or BEP-20.

48
00:02:39,594 --> 00:02:42,451
It must match the network of the receiving wallet.

49
00:02:42,391 --> 00:02:45,434
If it doesn't, your funds can be lost forever.

50
00:02:45,374 --> 00:02:50,349
Tip: send a small test amount first, and once it arrives, send the rest.

51
00:02:51,569 --> 00:02:54,348
Finally, some golden safety rules.

52
00:02:54,288 --> 00:02:57,327
Never share your password, your two-factor codes,

53
00:02:57,267 --> 00:02:59,816
or your recovery phrase with anyone.

54
00:02:59,756 --> 00:03:02,815
Real support staff will never ask for them.

55
00:03:02,755 --> 00:03:06,303
Ignore anyone who promises guaranteed profits.

56
00:03:06,243 --> 00:03:08,369
It's almost always a scam.

57
00:03:08,309 --> 00:03:12,714
And always double-check the address and the network before you confirm.

58
00:03:13,934 --> 00:03:15,412
Let's recap.

59
00:03:15,352 --> 00:03:18,785
Choose a trusted exchange, secure your account,

60
00:03:18,725 --> 00:03:23,972
verify your identity, add funds, buy USDT, and withdraw carefully.

61
00:03:23,912 --> 00:03:25,045
That's it!

62
00:03:24,985 --> 00:03:27,625
You're ready to buy your first USDT.

63
00:03:27,565 --> 00:03:29,356
Thanks for watching!

